# dist/ build artifacts are NO LONGER committed — every rebuilt PDF/EPUB/xtc
# added a new 40-60 MB blob kept forever, bloating .git to 1.7 GB and making
# fetch/clone slow. Regenerate with `npm run build` / `npm run build:x4-*`.
# To share built files, attach them to a GitHub Release instead of committing.
